    you would Tribute to activate "Assault Mode Activate" can be chosen from your
    Extra Deck instead (even if this card has left the field). You can only use this
    effect of "Duel Evolution - Assault Zone" once per turn. You can only activate
    1 "Duel Evolution - Assault Zone" per turn.'
